        "text": "Petitioner Le\u202fRoy\u202fTorres served in the Army Reserve, was deployed to Iraq in 2007, and was exposed to toxic burn pits."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0d9bd5ffa502bd21f5b05f50079d412e2fc00deb624222da935825c2ec2ba7fb",
